    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d447">

                <pb facs="0457" n="367" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg367"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/11342b</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-09-05T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 5,
                                1918, 5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For immediate transmission to Irkutsk:</p>
                <p>Please cable Department the following: <list>
                        <label>(1)</label>
                        <item>The number of Russian military forces cooperating with the Czechs west
                            of Irkutsk, including European Russia;</item>
                        <label>(2)</label>
                        <item>Their organization and to what extent it is developed;</item>
                        <pb facs="0458" n="368" xml:id="pg368"/>
                        <label>(3)</label>
                        <item>Their supplies, what they are and how obtained;</item>
                        <label>(4)</label>
                        <item>Their morale;</item>
                        <label>(5)</label>
                        <item>Whether they are subject to proper military discipline;</item>
                        <label>(6)</label>
                        <item>Whether they are representative of the real sentiment of the Siberian
                            people;</item>
                        <label>(7)</label>
                        <item>Who are their leaders.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>Cable preliminary report at once.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
